      "body": "@NVIDIA/mcore-oncall This small compatibility regression is currently blocking the MCore `main` pin bump in [Megatron Bridge #5968](https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/Megatron-Bridge/pull/5968). Could a vetter please approve CI for this Draft PR?\n\nThe focused regression test fails before the patch at the unguarded Transformer Engine import and passes after it. Both `Run tests` and `Run MBridge tests` were applied before CI starts so the downstream integration evidence can exercise the fix.\n",
